{"ID":"20240515142922-hh4v4cz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142922-hh4v4cz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142922-hh4v4cz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143604-u2l5y57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143604-u2l5y57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143604-u2l5y57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:388,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:388\u0026#125;","title":"110","type":"doc","updated":"20240515184517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143604-u2l5y57","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 961px;","id":"20240515143604-u2l5y57","updated":"20240515184517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YP"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"～40，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/07"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右膝蓋因踢足球受過傷，雙踝皆受傷。右肩偶爾痛。後腦枕骨位痛。鼻塞，流白涕。背部皮膚呈褐色、乾、且蛻皮，很癢。胸口也有。已多年。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無寒熱的感覺"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便黃色"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 皮下積濕未退"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右膝五針→右膝痛；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙商丘透丘墟→雙踝痛；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左後溪，左申脈，右肩井，左足三里→右肩痛；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷，迎香→鼻塞；"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曲池→上半身止癢穴"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃二錢，杏仁二錢，薏苡仁五錢，甘草二錢，連翹二錢，銀花二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大火煮，6碗水煮成2碗，早晚餐前各服1碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"21付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.麻杏苡甘湯多用於皮下積濕造成的皮膚癢乾。因皮下積濕阻擋新的水取代舊·的水，故皮膚會乾。麻黃發表；杏仁與麻黃相配，補足肺的津液，并滋潤肌膚；薏苡仁收皮下積濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.連翹、銀花，質輕，走皮表，倪師常配與經方一起，治皮膚癢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}